  "prefLabel": "Lot 7212.02 Reporting of Criminal Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7212.02 Reporting of Criminal Activities. In accordance with RSA 287-D:15, III(b), the GOE shall immediately forward to the commission all reports and digital recordings involving suspected or confirmed gaming crimes, unlawful activities, or actions of investigations.\n\nSource. #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25; ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7211.02)",
